 X5 / PULUZ Protective Cage pour Insta360 X5 / STARTRC Metal Cage pour Insta360 X5 / Insta360 X5 Utility Frame / K&F Concept Camera Cage pour Insta360 X4 / SmallRig Camera Cage pour Insta360 X4 / Ulanzi Camera Cage pour Insta360 X4 / TELESIN Camera Cage pour Insta360 X4 / Sunnylife Camera Cage pour Insta360 X4 / PULUZ Camera Cage pour Insta360 X4.',590.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Accessoires Insta360',14,'images/products/Design-sans-titre-9.jpg',1000,1000,'high','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(642,'Protective Case for Insta-360 X5','KF31.188','protective-case-for-insta-360-x5','【Protects the body and lens】Provides all-round protection for the camera to prevent scratches, fingerprints, and dust. It does not affect the normal use of interface buttons.\n\n【Perfectly fits X5】You can install the battery and connect the USB normally without removing the protective cover, and it will not affect the microphone reception and speaker.\n\n【High-quality silicone material】The soft silicone material not only brings you a skin-like touch, but also provides you with a safe enough drop-proof effect. Soft and lightweight, it protects your device from the effects of daily use, including dirt, oil, scratches and drops.\n\n【Easy to install】Insert the camera cover through the largest opening - the screen opening, which is quick and convenient.',250.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Accessoires',10,'images/products/Design-sans-titre-10.jpg',1000,1000,'high','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(643,'Magnetic Neck Phone','SKU.2288','magnetic-neck-phone','K&F Concept Action Camera Magnetic Neck Mount Price in Bangladesh\nCapture Life from Your Perspective – Hands-Free, Effortless, Magnetic. Experience a new level of convenience and freedom with the K&F Concept SKU.2288 Magnetic Neck Mount, designed for all types of action cameras and smartphones. Whether you’re walking, biking, vlogging, or live streaming, this mount allows you to record stable, first-person footage — completely hands-free.\nRevolutionize your point-of-view (POV) content creation with the K&F Concept SKU.2288 Magnetic Neck Mount. This innovative and versatile mount allows you to securely and comfortably wear your action camera or smartphone around your neck, capturing immersive, hands-free footage and photos from a unique chest-level perspective. Perfect for vlogging, tutorials, cooking demonstrations, outdoor adventures, and more, this magnetic neck mount offers a stable and convenient way to record your activities without the need for bulky harnesses or tripods. Its strong magnetic attachment ensures your device stays securely in place while allowing for quick and easy adjustments.\n\nUniversal Compatibility: Works with GoPro, DJI Osmo Action, Insta360, and smartphones (with magnetic or clamp adapter).\nStrong Magnetic Hold: Dual-sided magnetic plates offer a firm, secure grip on your device — even during movement.\nComfortable Neck Design: Ergonomic and lightweight for all-day wear without fatigue.\nTrue First-Person POV: Ideal angle for immersive storytelling and real-time content creation.\nQuick Setup & Removal: Easy to mount and dismount your camera or phone without tools.\nStrong Magnetic Attachment: Features powerful magnets that provide a reliable and stable hold for your device.\nEasy to Attach and Detach: The magnetic design allows for quick and effortless mounting and unmounting camera or smartphone.\nIdeal for Various Activities: Perfect for vlogging, cooking, DIY projects, outdoor adventures, live streaming, and more.\nDurable Construction: Built with high-quality materials to ensure long-lasting performance.\n\n \n\nLes compatibles :\n\nSmartphone Apple iPhone 12 avec MagSafe / Smartphone Apple iPhone 12 Plus avec MagSafe / Smartphone Apple iPhone 12 Pro avec MagSafe / Smartphone Apple iPhone 12 Pro Max avec MagSafe / Smartphone Apple iPhone 13 avec MagSafe / Smartphone Apple iPhone 13 Mini avec MagSafe / Smartphone Apple iPhone 